            "bottom": "Precision",
            "text": "Pixel-accurate interfaces that stay true to the design, whether it starts as a design file, a style guide, a sketch or an existing product. I translate it into consistent, responsive layouts, with attention to spacing, typography and the small details that make a product feel finished."
        },
        "maintainableCode": {
            "top": "Maintainable",
            "bottom": "Code",
            "text": "Code the next developer can pick up without a guided tour. Clear structure, typed components, tests where they matter and small, reviewable changes, so a project stays easy to extend long after launch."
        },
