            "top": "Accessible",
            "bottom": "UI",
            "text": "Interfaces everyone can use. With a background as an accessibility advisor, I build on the WCAG guidelines from the start: semantic HTML, keyboard navigation, screen-reader support and sufficient contrast."
        },
